$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM (5R,6S,7S,8E,10S)-10-[2-(tert-Butyldiphenylsilyloxy)ethyl]-5,6-epoxy-2-iodo-6,10,14-trimethylpentadeca-1,8,13-trien-7-ol
(24a) and (5R,6S,7R,8E,10S)-isomer (24b). The following reaction was
carried out under Ar. To a cooled (-78 °C) stirred solution of 9 (252 mg,
0.461 mmol) in THF (2 mL) was added t-BuLi (1.61 M solution in pentane,
0.57 mL, 0.92 mmol). The mixture was stirred at -78 °C for 1 h, and a
solution of 8 (80% ee, 256 mg, 0.962 mmol) in THF (1 mL) was added. After
being stirred at -78 °C for 1 h, the mixture was quenched with saturated
aqueous NH4Cl (10 mL), diluted with H2O (4 mL), and extracted with
EtOAc/hexane (1:1, 7 mL × 3). The combined extracts were dried and
concentrated under reduced pressure. The residue was purified by column
chromatography on silica gel (EtOAc/hexane, 1:10). 164 mg (52%) of 24a
and 31.1 mg (10%) of 24b. Compound 24a (80% de determined by 1H NMR
analysis) was obtained as a colorless oil. Compound 24b (80% de
determined by 1H NMR analysis) was obtained as a colorless oil. 24a: TLC
Rf 0.55 (EtOAc/hexane, 1:5); [α]25 D +3.8 (c 0.655, CHCl3); IR (neat)
3472, 2930 cm-1; 1H NMR (500 MHz, CDCl3) δ 0.96 (s, 3H), 1.03 (s, 9H),
1.16 (s, 3H), 1.21-1.33 (m, 2H), 1.54 (br s, 3H), 1.65 (br s, 3H),
1.63-1.70 (m, 2H), 1.76-1.87 (m, 2H), 1.88-1.99 (m, 2H), 2.48-2.67 (m,
2H), 2.80 (dd, 1H, J = 5.2, 7.5 Hz), 3.59-3.72 (m, 2H), 3.98 (br d, 1H, J
= 6.1 Hz), 5.02 (br t, 1H, J = 6.7 Hz), 5.35 (dd, 1H, J = 6.1, 16.0 Hz),
5.58 (br d, 1H, J = 16.0 Hz), 5.74 (br s, 1H), 6.10 (br s, 1H), 7.33-7.44
(m, 6H), 7.61-7.70 (m, 4H); 13C NMR (125 MHz, CDCl3) δ 17.6, 18.4, 19.1,
22.7, 23.2, 25.6, 26.8 (3C), 27.4, 38.0, 41.3, 42.6, 43.2, 60.9, 62.4,
63.3, 73.1, 110.5, 124.6, 125.4, 126.3, 127.6 (4C), 129.5 (2C), 131.2,
133.9 (2C), 135.5 (4C), 141.8; HRMS (ESI) calcd for C36H51IKO3Si (M+K+)
m/z 725.2289, found 725.2274. 24b: TLC Rf 0.38 (EtOAc/hexane, 1:5); [α]25
D +8.1 (c 0.175, CHCl3); IR (neat) 3444, 2930 cm-1; 1H NMR (500 MHz,
CDCl3) δ 0.96 (s, 3H), 1.03 (s, 9H), 1.20 (s, 3H), 1.22-1.32 (m, 2H),
1.55 (br s, 3H), 1.66 (br s, 3H), 1.62-1.70 (m, 3H), 1.78-1.89 (m, 3H),
2.47 (m, 1H), 2.58 (m, 1H), 2.78 (dd, 1H, J = 4.3, 8.4 Hz), 3.58-3.70 (m,
2H), 3.98 (br d, 1H, J = 5.6 Hz), 5.02 (br t, 1H, J = 6.5 Hz), 5.27 (dd,
1H, J = 5.6, 16.0 Hz), 5.59 (br d, 1H, J = 16.0 Hz), 5.73 (br s, 1H),
6.08 (br s, 1H), 7.32-7.45 (m, 6H), 7.61-7.70 (m, 4H); 13C NMR (125 MHz,
CDCl3) δ 16.6, 17.6, 19.1, 22.8, 23.4, 25.7, 26.8 (3C), 28.1, 37.9, 41.2,
42.6, 43.0, 60.9, 63.4, 63.7, 73.6, 110.2, 124.6, 125.1, 126.5, 127.6
(4C), 129.6 (2C), 131.3, 133.9 (2C), 135.6 (4C), 141.3; HRMS (ESI) calcd
for C36H51INaO3Si (M+Na+) m/z 709.2550 found 709.2532.
